{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/105065","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/105065/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/105065/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/105065/events","html_url":"https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/105065","id":2114937884,"node_id":"I_kwDOAAe_f85-D2Qc","number":105065,"title":"Avoid race in `LocalHealthMonitor` w.r.t `null` values","user":{"login":"nielsbauman","id":33722607,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNzIyNjA3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33722607?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbauman","html_url":"https://github.com/nielsbauman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbauman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbauman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbauman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbauman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbauman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbauman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbauman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbauman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbauman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":23173,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzE3Mw==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/labels/%3Ebug","name":">bug","color":"b60205","default":false,"description":null},{"id":1967496097,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxOTY3NDk2MDk3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/labels/Team:Data%20Management%20(obsolete)","name":"Team:Data Management (obsolete)","color":"fef2c0","default":false,"description":"DO NOT USE. This team no longer exists."},{"id":3772025920,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAAe_f87g1IxA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/labels/:Distributed/Health","name":":Distributed/Health","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"Issues for the health report API"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2024-02-02T13:28:36Z","updated_at":"2024-03-08T12:43:31Z","closed_at":"2024-03-08T12:43:30Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Follow up on [this](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/104614#discussion_r1475667009) thread.\r\n\r\nThere is a race condition in the `LocalHealthMonitor` regarding `null` values (i.e. initial/reset values):\r\n- Last reported value was null\r\n- there is new a health node\r\n- New run starts the update process and records previous value null\r\n- health node/master change\r\n- new reported value is null\r\n- Run sees null and considers that it's ok to update the value....\r\n\r\nCan probably relatively easily be fixed by using some form of ref counting/versioning of the `lastReportedValue`.","closed_by":{"login":"elasticsearchmachine","id":58790826,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NzkwODI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58790826?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine","html_url":"https://github.com/elasticsearchmachine","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/105065/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/105065/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}